Subject: [PATCH v2 1/4] dt-bindings: rtc: pcf85363: Document pcf85263 real-time clock
Date:   Thu, 29 Nov 2018 16:54:43 +0000
Message-Id: <1543510486-29532-2-git-send-email-biju.das@bp.renesas.com>
